!la cmeclax po'u le cmevi'u ke'umri

I started running an anonymous remailer in August, 2000, and since then have set up a [http://lexx.shinn.net/cmeclax/|web page]. I have also written a few programs:

* '''pingstats''' computes remailer statistics, and is now used by several other remailers;
* '''cupyvei''' maintains a fixed-size circular log file, instead of rotating logfiles every day, week, or month;
* '''nilsimsa''' computes the amount of similarity between two files in property trigraph statistics, and is used to filter out spam.
